{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_16_level_main_16-16_beg",
  "groupId": "main_16",
  "stageId": "main_16-15",
  "title": "示我以真",
  "storyCode": "16-16",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-16_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0d7668f85bd757e77a147bb7f7136de06d05ad2baa25491fda2c67563a586d40",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g11_abandonedsentry"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮躁的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（打哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精神点，还有两个小时才换班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮躁的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*......冰天雪地的，连一只裂兽都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......你听到什么声音没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮躁的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "士兵转过头，刚想说些什么，一支弩箭便射穿了他同伴的脑袋。\n啊？\n啊，啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷尔金！下面的已经全部解决了！我们这就冲上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！不要冒进！回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "矿工们聚集在哨所的脚下，死死地盯着头顶来回闪烁的警报灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心头顶的攻击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工A&矿工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激动的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们被发现了！他们要撤掉梯子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能从正面突破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三队，带上所有炸药跟着我。我们唯一的目标就是突破哨所的大门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我倒下了，不要停留，接替我冲上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "四队，五队，继续发射弩箭，做好掩护！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其余人维持包围圈，不要放走任何一个士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工C&矿工D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听我口令——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "探照灯的光线捕捉到了众人的行迹，紧接着便是一阵骤雨般的射击。\n雷尔金不断地腾挪向前，尽可能靠近哨所，他举起弩，瞄准了众人头顶的那一盏致命的探照灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，雷尔金感到自己的额头一阵刺痛，他的左眼被一抹红色覆盖。\n鲜血从他的额头缓缓流下，使他的脑内嗡嗡作响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧虑的矿工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷尔金？雷尔金！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚定的矿工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能撤退！剩下的人跟我顶上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的矿工",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他妈的，反正前后都是死路，死也要拉几个下来垫背！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "身旁人的呼喊若即若离，他听到弩箭射入血肉的声音，他听到周围不断有人倒下。\n不可以倒下，不可以在离胜利如此之近的地方倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g11_abandonedsentry"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他用尽最后一点力气向自己的四肢发出指令，他再次举起了弩，对准上方那一点刺眼的光源，扣动了扳机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的火力变弱了！快跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是现在，预备——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚定的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "门被炸开了——大家跟我一起冲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "矿工们的声音越来越遥远，雷尔金必须努力跟上他们的步伐。\n而在生死互搏的战斗中，没有人会注意到他的异样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他扶着被炸得支离破碎的断壁残垣，一点点朝高处走去。\n意识在一点点恢复，身体似乎也慢慢适应了疼痛。\n他跨过了无数上一秒还鲜活的躯体。螺旋上升的阶梯一直延伸到最高处的出口，那小小的洞口圈住了乌萨斯极夜最美的一簇极光。\n恍惚间，他想到了矿井，他坐着电梯一路向上的时候，也是这样仰望着头顶唯一的光亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迈过最后一级阶梯，他站在了极光之中，他站在了群星之下，他回到了同伴之间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷尔金，你还好吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没事，我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金抹去了额头上渗出的鲜血，环视了一圈身边的兄弟姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人少了一半......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚定的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但我们成功了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们成功了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "极目远望，圣骏堡的方向依然被一片层叠的针叶林遮住，巨大的冰面似乎在嘲弄他们发起的挑战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们从阴暗的矿洞里爬到了地面上，现在我们又站到了集团军的岗哨上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们接下来会越过冰湖，穿过树林，将旗帜插在更多地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金目光如炬，他想将自己的信念传递给每一个人。\n所有人的脸上也都洋溢着胜利的喜悦，他们等待这天已太久太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "终于，尼克托——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷尔金下意识侧过身，却没有在身旁看到那个熟悉的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......尼克托？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在第一根弩箭发射出去的时候，我就逃走了。\n害怕不是什么可耻的事，只有最蠢的蠢人才不知道害怕。\n雷尔金是个疯子，跟随他的人也是。\n我本来想拉他们一把的，如果他们执意要去送死，那就去好了。\n可是我还不能死。\n从皮匠到教书匠，再到伯爵的养子，我做了那么多事，不是为了轻飘飘地把命送在那种地方的。\n死了，就什么都没了。\n我总得想办法活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面，前面就是沃尔格勒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......从头再来吧，尼克托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1967_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......那是什么东西啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g11_abandonedsentry"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚定的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，火把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚定的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们应该点起火把，让其他人知道我们已经成功了！让他们过来会合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对......没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把火生起来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "远处传来沉闷的低音，响彻整个冰原，震颤着每个人的耳膜和心脏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷静的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么动静？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚定的矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你们看远处......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "众人朝那个矿工所指的方向看去，庞大的高速战舰正从地平线缓缓升起，它大到几乎让人难以分辨那究竟是舰艇还是巨型移动城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "方才的那片针叶林如风卷残云般被抹平，而星辰也被一片红色的光芒掩盖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雪和树木的躯干一齐被卷入空中，它们在此刻没有任何区别，都被撕碎、扬起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到此刻......\n人们才知道他们面对的是什么。\n乌萨斯。\n这就是乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g11_abandonedsentry"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷尔金",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，竟然是这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Raidian......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚刚收到了一条公共广播的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "广播里说，乌萨斯的矿脉正在全面枯竭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "集团军准备完全封锁这个消息，目前至少有一支军队已经来到远北地区......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这条消息是博士他们传来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不确定，但是很有可能。这是博士对我们的提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿脉枯竭，难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，我不明白，乌萨斯想要彻底封锁这条消息？难道他们准备将远北地区所有知道这件事的人都灭口吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......果然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿脉枯竭的传闻是真的......原来远北地区一直以来发生的种种异常都是有迹可循的，这才是他们一直想要隐瞒的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看上去好像早有预料？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到刚才都还只是一个最悲观的猜想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如今我有理由相信这消息是真的，我更不会怀疑集团军中的一部分人能做出这种事来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在整片大地上都不会有比远北地区更危险的地方了，我们必须马上离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我们还没有和博士他们取得联络——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们收到了来自他们的提醒，说明至少在情报上，他们处在比我们更主动的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何况我们现在回过头去甚至不一定能找到他们，只会浪费时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，Mon3tr可以保护博士的安全，比起大部队，他们反而不容易成为目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，阿洛伊泽“中士”，如果集团军是代表乌萨斯来封锁这条消息，我们又该如何相信你说的圣骏堡是一个安全的去处？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们还是不信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们的确需要确保......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“凯尔希”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在不久前，乌萨斯再次注意到了这个名字。这位神秘的女士在乌萨斯——乃至整片大地留下的痕迹，都太过离奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与她有关的信息于乌萨斯而言已经接近最高机密，也正因为如此，有人期待她能够解答乌萨斯如今面临的一些问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你究竟是谁......是什么身份？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重新自我介绍一下吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿洛伊泽·瓦西里耶夫娜·戈尔奇科娃，乌萨斯近卫军皇家直属营中尉。我的上级之一......是维特议长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这次来到远北地区有两项任务——调查中心矿区的变异感染者及相关异常事件，以及......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......与罗德岛取得联系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，这是一次迟到的坦诚，我也的确想过将这个秘密保留到最后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你们现在是否相信，但我要是有任何敌意，早在布列斯克城内，各位就已经身陷囹圄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛并不欢迎这样的合作方式，但我同样可以理解您的立场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我们先搁置争议吧......阿洛伊泽小姐，您准备的撤离方案是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅瓦湖西南岸，离这里大约十公里的地方，有我事先准备好的载具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备得不算充裕，但应该够接走这里的所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以先将所有人暗中安置在圣骏堡城外的村落，再另找机会，让各位在圣骏堡的庇护下入城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mantra女士说，这里的人都还处在圣愚的影响下，我们需要先让他们摆脱圣愚的控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她能发现圣愚，却没有解决办法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅小姐，我绝对不愿意坐视悲剧发生，但更不会忘记自己的使命。我必须确保，我们当中有人可以活着将消息带回圣骏堡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你们执意要保护这里的所有人一起离开......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最多等你们一个小时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解，我会抓紧时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我已经找到了突破口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mantra仔细地将自己的感知投射到这里的每一个角落。\n在几乎所有思绪都陷入麻木、毫无波动时，她抓住了一丝微小的不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......奶奶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们......走吧？离开，这里，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您，起身，所有人都会......和您，一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们去，南方，去圣骏堡，或者去......任何地方。只是不在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别乔克单膝跪地，跪在被她认作奶奶的虚影身前。她握住在Mantra眼中并不存在的双手，然后将脸颊紧紧地贴了上去。\n直到看见女孩脸上流下的一行泪水，Mantra才惊觉这信任如此令人战栗，即使没有任何回应，女孩仍继续这样做着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mantra回想起刚才Raidian的话。\n“别乔克的父母因为组织罢工而被判处死刑，奶奶是她如今唯一的亲人。”\n“似乎在矿区里，所有人都认识娜迦，甚至就连卫兵也不例外。”\n“他们会向她寻求帮助，比向流动医疗队求助更加频繁。病痛时寻求宽慰，心伤时寻求开解，最后都在她的话语中获得奇异的平静。”\n“......我早该意识到有问题，我竟然以为她只是一位颇有名望的老人。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，求您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mantra注视着眼前的女孩，让自己的声音缓缓出现在她的脑海中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她认为，你们能在这里获得平静。\n在所有的希望都破灭以后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4207_branch_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别乔克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别乔克转头，只看见站在自己身后的斐迪亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您、您知道，我的名字？可我没有......告诉过您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少在这里，你的表达应该是清晰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是你的话语一如平常，说明受到的影响并不深刻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许你还有清醒的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜迦是你的亲人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，她是......我的奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是我，唯一的，亲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你确信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是，我的奶奶，我当然，确信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你的奶奶会要求所有人忍耐痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让他们既不想活下去，也不会主动结束痛苦，选择死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不会——奶奶没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她只是，累了。就像大家......大家都只是，累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们想活。我们当然想！可总有人，不让我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纠、纠察队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们击退了纠察队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也还有，卫兵和......研究所里，那些人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们也不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有谁不让你们活着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑漆漆的......怪物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有......还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪？我想不起......我想不起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我重新问一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被你握着手的那个人，是你的亲人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回头看看吧，别乔克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别乔克不想回头。只要不回过头去，被自己紧握的那双冰冷而干枯的手，就会永远维持着记忆中的模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我。你看到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不能回头。不能回头。不能回头。\n她这样告诉自己。\n最终，她还是回过头去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奶奶就在她的面前。唱着摇篮曲的奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到......娜迦奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。你仔细看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奶奶在她的面前。双手冰冷的奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，你看到什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到......圆。还看到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g4_miningarea_polluted"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——红色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别乔克不断摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总是红色？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "坐着的奶奶，站立的奶奶，身上变换着诡异色彩的奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "决定了自己能够死去的、倒在血泊中的奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g3_miningarea"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑剔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，乌萨斯这鬼天气可真是冷得要命！哪里像是秋天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑剔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "露天的宴会，既没有草坪，也没有野餐桌？您说说，您邀请我们到这儿来，究竟能欣赏些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欣赏在卡西米尔花钱也买不到的娱乐项目，你就等着吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑剔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，左不过是拿生死来演戏。就凭一路过来在路边瞧见的那些矿工？畏首畏尾的，恐怕精彩程度远不如骑士竞技呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士竞技吧，年年都有，年年都看。可在布列洁诺伊的这位女大公治下，十几年都不会判处一桩死刑呢！我们这次来算是见着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑剔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死刑？什么人物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一对密谋组织感染者进行罢工的矿工，在举事时被当场抓获。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑剔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀，这可真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，事件性质极其恶劣，听说女大公签署死刑命令的时候还落下泪来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，这里对感染者没有执行人道死刑的先例。走两步路把他们直接埋进沼泽里当然可以，但那不就白白辜负了这少有的死刑判决吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我们就在这儿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照流程，最开始上身的是鞭刑，据说还能让我们这些花了门票钱的嘉宾来选鞭子的样式，带不带刀片，沾不沾盐水......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑剔的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万一力度没控制好，他们突然死了，身上的石头炸在我们面前怎么办？我的裙子可是为这趟旅程新做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝对不会！他们的感染程度还没到那份上，要是不犯事，离病死都还有好几年呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于你刚才说的宴会啦，野餐啦，该有的都会有的。总之一会儿就能看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，让我们先上火堆那边暖暖身子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有气吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女的、女的还在说些大逆不道的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "男的已经死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "舌头昨天就割了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么不给女的也割了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天那群客人，没、没说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们想听她尖叫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她叫了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没！一声都没，一直在翻来覆去地说那些“诉求”，说“为了矿区里死掉的其他孩子”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一句都听不懂！她肯定是疯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不疯也不会想着让所有人罢工了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，把那女人的舌头也割了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个小孩，她好像昨天也站在那儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对。治安官让她一直站在那里看，直到她父母咽气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就等她父母咽气，把她送回矿工宿舍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她出生在矿井里，那她就是矿工。等她爹妈都咽气了，她还得拿着她妈妈的矿灯和编号，继续下矿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她手上拿灯了吗？你看到她手上拿着矿灯了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "执勤卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就*乌萨斯粗口*完事送她回宿舍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别乔克......孩子，你拿着。你拿着这些。黄油、肉糜、巧克力......对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别、别误会！我家那口子绝对没有出卖你爹娘！这是我下井，我推车，我自己挣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后你家就只有你和你奶奶了，你要好好待她，听到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她刚才找我借了剪刀，也不用还给我了。有什么困难，就来找我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能帮的都会帮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矿工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。要是我的孩子还活着，也该有你这么大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她后来还说了什么，我没有回答。\n是因为我当时没办法说话，还是因为我已经走开，回到了家里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "总之，后来我看到红色——\n红色流淌在白得发灰的塑料上。\n我以为我回到了外面，回到了那片空地上......但，不，不是。\n是奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "经过昨天，还有今天，我知道人身体里的红色并不是无穷无尽的。它会流干，它会让人痛苦，它会带来死亡。\n于是我试图用手把那些流向四周的红色留住，像小时候和朋友玩过的那个游戏。\n“看啊，谁捧起的流水最多，谁就拥有了最多的幸福。”\n“谁用袋子网住的狂风最多，谁就拥有了最多的自由。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜、呜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不——不、不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我留不住。\n我应该留住。\n我留不——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "失温的身体在我眼前陷进塑料里，陷进泥土中。我抬起头。我看到“它”。\n一个苍白的、站立的虚影。\n我喊道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您曾经让我，忍耐，和，原谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了活着，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们现在，还要......忍耐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在......忍耐，并分担，其他的痛苦，只会死，也只有死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道忍耐，其实只为......一无所有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "渴望拥有任何事物，会滋生的只是罪孽。你那受苦的灵魂，此刻更需要永恒的安宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，来我怀中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......难道，您也原谅了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原谅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们需要接受乌萨斯赐予的生，一如接受乌萨斯赐予的死。不做选择，不做挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "害死妈妈，害死爸爸......害死你亲生的，孩子。你原谅了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我原谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我原谅”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就......不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是，娜迦奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶不会这样，原谅。不会为了，得到平静，而原谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不原谅，她不忍耐。她死了，埋进......泥土里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜迦？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "■■，不顺从■■......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "便......■■毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "■■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别乔克，退后！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，她不是！她不是，娜迦奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，它不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可如果，她不是，奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她又是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mantra周身浮动着源石技艺的特殊光芒，在她的助力下，敌人显露真容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但事情还没有结束。她必须进一步建造基于意识空间的屏障，以将自身与眼前的存在，和周围的普通人隔绝开来。\n在完成之前，她继续传达真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“圣愚”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它就是你问过的圣愚，是有着这一名称的邪魔造物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它也许曾经是人类，但如今已和这一概念相去甚远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使我曾有万分之一的可能成为它，我也从未弄懂它的本质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你只是在错误的时间看到了它，呼唤了它。仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "错误的时间？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别乔克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......从一开始，就是错的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "■■■，■■......■■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是你的错，别乔克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1964_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从现在起，这里由我接手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
